FeatureFlagChangeResponse.description:
One line of a flag's history. `from` and `to` hold a percentage's digits, or `on` and `off` for everyone else;
`tenant` the organisation listed or removed, with its name now; `revision` the commit of the deploy that added or removed the
flag. `actor` is the system admin, with their name now, and none for a deploy.

MyTermsResponseAction.description:
What the signed-in person must do about the terms: nothing; give their acceptance of the version, which the gate after sign-in asks;
or read the notice of a version that requires no acceptance, which Home shows until the person closes it. The values are words no other
code of the screens uses as a literal (F3).
